+# TLS Certificate Verification Policy
+
+This project requires TLS certificate verification on all builds, including development builds, with no exceptions. An earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification in development builds to ease local testing was proposed and subsequently rejected, and this requirement was further reinforced by a global HTTPS-only policy that mandates TLS encryption and certificate verification for all connections, internal and external, with no plaintext or unverified exceptions permitted.
